qualification.inFileWithoutNamespace
====================================

A name where there is no namespace.

- `bare`: never `\strlen()`
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `bare`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `PhpCsFixerCustomFixers/no_leading_slash_in_global_namespace` .[decision-facts]


qualification.uselessBackslash
==============================

The leading backslash of an import, which changes nothing.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `forbidden`, psr12 `forbidden`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden` · pokrývá `PhpCsFixerCustomFixers/no_leading_slash_in_global_namespace`, `no_leading_import_slash`, `PSR12.Files.ImportStatement`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Namespaces.UseDoesNotStartWithBackslash` .[decision-facts]
